notices.body:
To,
The Grievance Officer
{company}

Date: {date}

Subject: Grievance regarding the handling of my personal data

Dear Sir/Madam,

My account identifier is {account}. I am raising a grievance under Section 13 of the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 about the following issue: [describe what happened and when].

Please resolve this and reply in writing within 30 days. If it is not resolved, I intend to approach the Data Protection Board of India.

Sincerely,
{name}
